WEBVTT

00:17:26.509 --> 00:17:30.136
I'm not saying that I support
the terrorists in Iraq.

00:17:30.779 --> 00:17:34.010
But as a sociologist, what I am saying is:

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.449
I understand.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:42.928
And now perhaps -- perhaps -- you do, too.

00:17:42.952 --> 00:17:44.104
Thank you.

00:17:44.128 --> 00:17:47.007
(Applause)